TITLE:: RCCrawlerMoves
summary:: The crawler's rhythm-morphing move generator
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCCrawler, Classes/RCRhythmDict

DESCRIPTION::
At each step the crawler holds the code::seq_list:: of its current orgnsm and a target from code::staticAttrs.rhythm_dict_target::. One elementary move is tried per step, in order: shift, changeSubseq, convergeMask, decreaseMask, switchOtherParams; each can take a wrong turn with its code::error_probability_*:: attribute. Only array-based subseqs can be morphed.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: nextValRhythmChange
The code::Pfunc:: to use as code::next_val:: in a crawler's pattern attributes. Yields code::[newSeqList]::.
METHOD:: computeNext
argument:: crawler
argument:: st
METHOD:: shift
METHOD:: changeSubseq
METHOD:: convergeMask
METHOD:: decreaseMask
METHOD:: switchOtherParams
